Enhancement: Add reusable zizmor workflow audit

Repositories can now audit their GitHub Actions workflows, composite actions
and Dependabot config with zizmor. Any finding fails the job, as an annotation
on the offending line. The org default config lets owncloud/* references stay
ref-pinned and requires a commit SHA for everything else. This repository's own
workflows were fixed to pass the audit: checkouts no longer persist credentials,
GitHub App tokens request only the permissions they use, setup-php version
comments match the upstream tag, and local reusable workflows are called with
the self-repository `$/` syntax.

https://github.com/owncloud/reusable-workflows/pull/PR
